st-XML/issues/1785","id":1382631203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SaUcj","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-14T01:57:27Z","updated_at":"2023-01-14T01:57:27Z","body":"Super close to BSD-3-CLAUSE OR gpl-v2.0-or-later\r\n\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1382631203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1382631498","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785#issuecomment-1382631498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785","id":1382631498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SaUhK","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-14T01:58:19Z","updated_at":"2023-01-14T01:58:19Z","body":"Note, the license includes a disjunctive statement to alternatively use \"GPL\" in the middle of the license. \r\n\r\nScancode seems to have logged both this variant at https://github.com/nexB/scancode-licensedb/blob/cf386c8c87910ba43352be8c2f93da96ee39dd50/docs/brian-gladman-dual.LICENSE\r\n\r\nand a variant without the \"alternatively...\" sentence here: https://scancode-licensedb.aboutcode.org/brian-gladman-3-clause.html\r\n\r\nI'd be curious to hear from @DennisClark if both variants have been found in the wild?!?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1382631498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1387354256","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785#issuecomment-1387354256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785","id":1387354256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85SsViQ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-18T16:30:57Z","updated_at":"2023-01-18T16:30:57Z","body":"That \"alternatively\" bit in the middle makes this fairly similar to the [Cryptogams license](https://www.openssl.org/~appro/cryptogams/) -- [discussed on the mailing list](https://lists.spdx.org/g/Spdx-legal/topic/new_license_exception/22080938) a few years ago, but I don't think ever added to the License List.\r\n\r\nThat said, although the rest is sort of a BSD-3-Clause, the wording is definitely different and the disclaimer is unique. So although it's similar in spirit to an \"OR\" for BSD-3-Clause / GPL-1.0-or-later, I'd say this could stand alone as a separate license ID.\r\n\r\nRegardless, I'm +1 to add -- historical license, clearly FOSS, in a major distro (Fedora).\r\n\r\nI'm fine with the proposed name. For the ID, I would probably capitalize the first letters of the first and last name -- that's the pattern we've used for other license IDs that use people's names (e.g. [here](https://spdx.org/licenses/libutil-David-Nugent.html), [here (to be published in 3.20)](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/1753)).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1387354256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1419915287","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785#issuecomment-1419915287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1785","id":1419915287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85UojAX","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-06T23:09:00Z","updated_at":"2023-02-06T23:09:00Z","body":"+1 to add, but still need to sort out what to do about the \"alternatively...\" paragraph in middle. maybe mark as optional?\r\n\r\n@pombredanne - do you have any thoughts on the above question re: the variants included in the Scancode db?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1419915287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hea